<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh says banking system on verge of collapse.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh says banking system on verge of collapse.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh Central Bank Governor Lutfar Rahman Sarkar said on Tuesday the country's banking system was on the verge of collapse due to the piling up of huge bad loans.</p>
</text>
